  <acqinfo id="aspace_03a8d147b831f1e9f0cf511307e8f6cb">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>Portions of this collection were the gifts of Mrs. Henry E. Drake, 1986, and St. Phebe's Mission, 1915. Sources and dates of acquisition for the majority of the collection are unknown.</p>  </acqinfo>
